      "id": "til-1KZeRbmWx91RX9KHWFYHER",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-07T07:13:27.015000-06:00",
      "text": "New research suggests matcha may help shrink tumors and limit how far cancer spreads, especially in aggressive breast cancers. It's early, and it's not a treatment. But I love seeing a simple, real drink get studied\u2026",
